ACKNOWLEDGEMENT
---------------

The idea of teaching Godot through a tile-matching game came from
GodotTileMatchingGameExample by Goldenlion5648 / ThinkWithGames
(https://github.com/Goldenlion5648/GodotTileMatchingGameExample), MIT licensed.

None of that project's code is used here. It builds the board from a TileMap
with atlas coordinates in a single script; this project is an independent
rewrite on Control nodes, with one scene per card, signals, and CSV-driven
decks. The acknowledgement is for the idea, not for code.


